# Publish individually reviewed paths. A new job script, capture, profile or
# sidecar must stay local even when saved next to a public file.
*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/examples/
!/examples/comparison.gif
!/examples/stitching.gif
!/.agents/
!/.agents/skills/
!/.agents/skills/pitch-panorama-video-editing/
